Subject: V2 [PATCH 2/3] Binutils: Pass --plugin to AR and RANLIB

Detect GCC LTO plugin.  Pass --plugin to AR and RANLIB to support LTO
build.

bfd/

	* configure: Regenerated.

binutils/

	* configure: Regenerated.

gas/

	* configure: Regenerated.

gprof/

	* configure: Regenerated.

ld/

	* configure: Regenerated.

libctf/

	* configure: Regenerated.

opcodes/

	* configure: Regenerated.
